{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の者！乃木坂46のほーむぺーじは見たかな⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついについについについについについにっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46がいこまちゃんの地元由利本荘市にやってくるど〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男鹿さも行きますが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっとずーっとずーっとずーっとずーっと地元でイベントしたいと願っておりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田のテレビやラジオに呼んで頂いたのは去年だったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時も秋田に乃木坂46のいこまちゃんとして来れたのがすっごく嬉しくて、でも今回は由利本荘市！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまちゃんの地元！\n住んでる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい！\nカダーレはいこまちゃん完成してから入った事ないのよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カダーレの話わかるの由利本荘市民だけだねっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元トーク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだメンバー発表されてないけどいこまちゃんは必ずいるからっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかいなかったら抗議する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男鹿行くの久しぶりだな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男鹿には水族館ありますよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男鹿水族館GAO  ←ガオ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏\n乃木坂46全国ツアーやりますが、いこまちゃん思ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北ないの〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道ある！\n東名阪ある！\n福岡ある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！\n東名阪だけじゃなくて北海道と福岡あるってことは東北もあるんじゃね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれあれっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないだと‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せめて‥‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せめて仙台！\nやまとまと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでいつもこーいうとき東北ぬかすのっ！激おこスティックファイナリープンプンドリーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですがっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でっすっがっ！\n秋田に来ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七月に！\n東北来ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから東北なくてザンネン〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか思っていたあなたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ！\n来てくださいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/14/9154527/